            "review_text": "LaurenRoseAdams\nSydney, Australia75 contributions\n0\nDelicious ice cream and great vibe!\nNov 2017 • Friends\nI went here with a friend after dinner and it was an all round great boutique ice creamery. They make the ice cream on request using nitrogen then top your flavour with various different sweets such as cookie crumble, gummi lollies and sultanas. It was a really great environment as well, good for all ages, but definitely targeted at teens to 20's. Delicious ice cream as well!\nRead more\nWritten November 9, 2017",
